s-earned" data-skill="Azure" title="Azure"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/microsoftazure/0089d6" alt="Azure" loading="lazy" /></span><span class="skill-badge is-earned" data-skill="Blender" title="Blender"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/blender/f5792a" alt="Blender" loading="lazy" /></span><span class="skill-badge is-earned" data-skill="Cloudflare" title="Cloudflare"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/cloudflare/f38020" alt="Cloudflare" loading="lazy" /></span><span class="skill-badge is-earned" data-skill="GitHub" title="GitHub"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/github/f0f0f0" alt="GitHub" loading="lazy" /></span><span class="skill-badge is-earned" data-skill="GitLab" title="GitLab"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/gitlab/fc6d26" alt="GitLab" loading="lazy" /></span><span class="skill-badge is-earned" data-skill="Gmail" title="Gmail"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/gmail/ea4335" alt="Gmail" loading="lazy" /></span><span class="skill-badge is-earned" data-skill="Java" title="Java"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/openjdk/ed8b00" alt="Java" loading="lazy" /></span><span class="skill-badge is-earned" data-skill="LaTeX" title="LaTeX"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/latex/008080" alt="LaTeX" loading="lazy" /></span><span class="skill-badge is-earned" data-skill="Linux" title="Linux"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/linux/fcc624" alt="Linux" loading="lazy" /></span><span class="skill-badge is-earned" data-skill="Markdown" title="Markdown"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/markdown/ffffff" alt="Markdown" loading="lazy" /></span><span class="skill-badge is-earned" data-skill="MySQL" title="MySQL"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/mysql/4479a1" alt="MySQL" loading="lazy" /></span><span class="skill-badge is-earned" data-skill="OCaml" title="OCaml"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/ocaml/ec6813" alt="OCaml" loading="lazy" /></span><span class="skill-badge is-earned" data-skill="PyTorch" title="PyTorch"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/pytorch/ee4c2c" alt="PyTorch" loading="lazy" /></span><span class="skill-badge is-earned" data-skill="Qt" title="Qt"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/qt/41cd52" alt="Qt" loading="lazy" /></span><span class="skill-badge is-earned" data-skill="Redis" title="Redis"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/redis/dc382d" alt="Redis" loading="lazy" /></span><span class="skill-badge is-earned" data-skill="scikit-learn" title="scikit-learn"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/scikitlearn/f7931e" alt="scikit-learn" loading="lazy" /></span><span class="skill-badge is-earned" data-skill="Unity" title="Unity"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/unity/f0f0f0" alt="Unity" loading="lazy" /></span><span class="skill-badge is-earned" data-skill="VS Code" title="VS Code"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/visualstudiocode/007acc" alt="VS Code" loading="lazy" /></span><span class="skill-badge is-earned" data-skill="Visual Studio" title="Visual Studio"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/visualstudio/5c2d91" alt="Visual Studio" loading="lazy" /></span><span class="skill-badge is-earned" data-skill="WordPress" title="WordPress"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/wordpress/21759b" alt="WordPress" loading="lazy" /></span><span class="skill-badge is-exploring" data-skill="Rust · Systems" title="Rust · Systems"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/rust/8d8d8d" alt="Rust" loading="lazy" /></span><span class="skill-badge is-exploring" data-skill="Docker · DevOps" title="Docker · DevOps"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/docker/8d8d8d" alt="Docker" loading="lazy" /></span></div></div><div class="widget-foot"><span>技术栈 / ACHIEVEMENTS</span><span>28 UNLOCKED · 04 EXPLORING</span></div></template>
<template id="dashboard-widget"><div class="dashboard-body"><div class="dashboard-kpis"><div><small>CONTRIBUTIONS / LAST YEAR</small><strong data-github-commits>--</strong><span data-github-status>同步中</span></div><div><small>REPOSITORIES</small><strong data-github-repos>--</strong><span>PUBLIC</span></div><div><small>TOTAL CODING TIME</small><strong data-wakatime-hours>--</strong><span data-wakatime-status>WAKATIME</span></div></div><div class="dashboard-section"><div class="dashboard-section-head"><span>LANGUAGE DISTRIBUTION</span><small data-language-updated>GITHUB API</small></div><div class="language-bars" data-language-bars><p class="dashboard-loading">正在读取仓库语言…</p></div></div></div><div class="widget-foot"><span>开发仪表盘 / TELEMETRY</span><button data-dashboard-refresh>刷新数据 ↻</button></div></template>
<template id="article-widget"><div class="article-body"><div class="article-heading"><div><span class="intro-eyebrow">PERSONAL ARTICLES / LOG</span><h3>最近文章</h3></div><span class="article-source">BLOG.MYRT1E.COM</span></div><div class="article-list" data-article-list><div class="article-loading">正在读取文章…</div></div></div><div class="widget-foot"><span>个人文章 / TASK LIST</span><a href="https://blog.myrt1e.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">打开博客 ↗</a></div></template>
<template id="weather-widget"><div class="weather-body"><div class="weather-heading"><div><span class="intro-eyebrow">LOCAL WEATHER / IP</span><h3 data-weather-city>定位中…</h3></div><span class="weather-icon" data-weather-icon>☁</span></div><div class="weather-main"><strong data-weather-temp>--°</strong><div><span data-weather-desc>读取天气中</span><small data-weather-daylight>昼夜状态检测中</small></div></div><div class="weather-meta"><span data-weather-location>IP GEOLOCATION</span><span data-weather-updated>--:--</span></div></div><div class="widget-foot"><span>天气环境 / OPEN-METEO</span><span data-weather-source>等待同步</span></div></template>
<template id="system-widget"><div class="system-body"><div class="system-heading"><div><span class="intro-eyebrow">SYSTEM MONITOR / SERVER</span><h3>系统状态</h3></div><span class="system-pulse" data-system-online>● ONLINE</span></div><div class="system-metrics"><div><span>CPU LOAD</span><strong data-system-cpu>--%</strong><i><b data-system-cpu-bar></b></i></div><div><span>MEMORY</span><strong data-system-memory>--%</strong><i><b data-system-memory-bar></b></i></div></div><div class="system-services"><span><i data-service-api></i>API</span><span><i data-service-github></i>GITHUB</span><span><i data-service-waka></i>WAKATIME</span></div></div><div class="widget-foot"><span>系统状态 / TELEMETRY</span><span data-system-updated>同步中</span></div></template>
<template id="live2d-widget"><div class="live2d-body"><div class="live2d-preview avatar-stage" data-avatar-stage><span class="live2d-plugin-mark">LIVE2D</span><span class="live2d-stage-note">INTERACTIVE AVATAR / PLUGIN</span></div><div class="live2d-copy"><span class="intro-eyebrow">LIVE2D AVATAR / 01</span><strong>互动角色 · ARCHIVE</strong><small data-live2d-status>正在启动插件…</small></div><div class="live2d-controls"><button data-live2d-launch>唤醒角色</button><button data-live2d-sleep>休眠</button><a class="live2d-source" href="https://l2d-widget.hacxy.cn" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">插件文档 ↗</a></div></div><div class="widget-foot"><span>LIVE2D / MODEL VIEWPORT</span><span>POWERED BY L2D-WIDGET</span></div></template>

<script>
  import L from 'leaflet';
  import { createWidget } from 'l2d-widget';
  import 'leaflet/dist/leaflet.css';
  type Kind = 'location' | 'quote' | 'intro' | 'contact' | 'time' | 'nowplaying' | 'terminal' | 'stack' | 'dashboard' | 'live2d' | 'article' | 'weather' | 'system';
  type Item = {id:string; kind:Kind; x:number; y:number; w:number; h:number; parentId?:string};
  const canvas = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-canvas]')!;
  const status = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-save-status]')!;
  let activeWorkspace = new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('workspace') || 'showcase';
  let key = `myrt1e-workspace-v1-${activeWorkspace}`;
  const tabsRoot=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-workspace-tabs]')!;const tabsKey='myrt1e-workspaces';
  let workspaceTabs:{id:string;name:string}[]=[];try{workspaceTabs=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(tabsKey)||'[]');if(!Array.isArray(workspaceTabs))workspaceTabs=[];}catch{}
  if(!workspaceTabs.some(tab=>tab.id==='showcase'))workspaceTabs.unshift({id:'showcase',name:'展示'});
  const persistTabs=()=>{try{localStorage.setItem(tabsKey,JSON.stringify(workspaceTabs));}catch{}};
  const renderTabs=()=>{tabsRoot.innerHTML=workspaceTabs.map(tab=>`<button class="workspace-tab-button${tab.id===activeWorkspace?' is-active':''}" data-workspace-id="${tab.id}">${tab.name}${tab.id==='showcase'?'<b class="tab-dot"></b>':''}</button>`).join('');tabsRoot.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-workspace-id]').forEach(button=>button.onclick=()=>{const id=button.dataset.workspaceId;if(id&&id!==activeWorkspace)switchWorkspace(id);});};
  renderTabs();persistTabs();
  document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-workspace-add]')!.onclick=()=>{const id=`workspace-${Date.now()}`;const name=`工作台 ${workspaceTabs.length}`;workspaceTabs.push({id,name});persistTabs();switchWorkspace(id);};
  const defaults = (): Item[] => [{id:'home',kind:'location',x:32,y:32,w:360,h:320},{id:'words',kind:'quote',x:424,y:96,w:360,h:290},{id:'profile',kind:'intro',x:220,y:430,w:440,h:310},{id:'contact',kind:'contact',x:690,y:450,w:390,h:230},{id:'time',kind:'time',x:690,y:710,w:390,h:210},{id:'media',kind:'nowplaying',x:32,y:780,w:360,h:270},{id:'logs',kind:'terminal',x:424,y:780,w:420,h:270},{id:'stack',kind:'stack',x:890,y:780,w:300,h:240},{id:'chiaki',kind:'live2d',x:890,y:1040,w:380,h:380},{id:'articles',kind:'article',x:32,y:1080,w:520,h:360},{id:'weather',kind:'weather',x:580,y:1080,w:360,h:280},{id:'system',kind:'system',x:32,y:1480,w:420,h:300}];
  let items = defaults();
  let topLayer = 1;
  let liveAvatar:any = null;
